      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Three of our faculty members presented research papers at the "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "59th Annual Conference of the Comparative and International Education Society",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "link",
                "attrs": {
                  "href": "http://convention2.allacademic.com/one/cies/cies15/index.php?cmd=Prepare+Online+Program&program_focus=main&PHPSESSID=bjmehn08rqo2ljvv6k7vd0inu3",
                  "target": "_blank",
                  "linktype": "url",
                  "uuid": null,
                  "anchor": null,
                  "custom": {}
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", held between March 8 to13, 2015 in Washington, D.C. The theme of the conference was \"Ubuntu! Imagining a Humanist Education Globally\"."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Click on the titles to read the abstracts of the papers."
